```text
scripts/check_environment.py
```

The script must validate the complete POC environment.

It should check:

```text
Python
uv
Git
Docker
Docker Compose
SQLite
sqlite-vec
GraphQLite
LLM endpoint
Llama 3.2
Embedding model
Google ADK
LiteLLM
```

Example output:

```text
=============================================
Self-Improving Agent - Environment Check
=============================================

[PASS] Python
[PASS] uv
[PASS] Git
[PASS] Docker
[PASS] Docker Compose
[PASS] SQLite
[PASS] sqlite-vec
[PASS] GraphQLite

[PASS] LLM endpoint
[PASS] llama3.2
[PASS] Embedding model

[PASS] Google ADK
[PASS] LiteLLM

=============================================
Environment is ready.
=============================================
```

If a dependency fails, the script must clearly identify it.

Example:

```text
