```

---

# 21. LLM Environment Test

The validation script must perform an actual LLM request.

Example:

```text
Request:
    Calculate 15% of 200.

Expected:
    30
```

The purpose is only to prove connectivity.

It must not implement agent reasoning or self-improvement.

---

# 22. Embedding Environment Test

The validation script must generate an embedding for a small test string.

Example:

```text
Calculate 15% of 200.
```

The test must verify:

```text
embedding exists
embedding is numeric
embedding has a valid dimension
```

---

# 23. SQLite Vector Test

Create a temporary vector table and perform:

```text
Insert vector
      ↓
Similarity search
      ↓
Retrieve nearest vector
```

The test data should be deleted afterward.

---

# 24. GraphQLite Test

Create temporary graph data:

```text
(Task: "Calculate percentage")
          │
          │ USES
          ▼
(Strategy: "Direct Calculation")
```

Verify that the relationship can be queried.

Delete the test graph data afterward.

This is only an infrastructure test.

