# 29. Acceptance Criteria

Phase 0 is complete when:

### AC-01

Python is installed and the project virtual environment works.

### AC-02

The project can be synchronized using:

```bash
uv sync
```

### AC-03

Git is available.

### AC-04

Docker Desktop is available and running.

### AC-05

The Docker-based Llama 3.2 service is reachable.

### AC-06

`llama3.2` successfully responds to a test prompt.

### AC-07

The embedding model successfully generates an embedding.

### AC-08

SQLite database creation works.

### AC-09

sqlite-vec vector insertion and similarity search work.

### AC-10

GraphQLite can create and query a graph relationship.

### AC-11

Google ADK 2 imports successfully.

### AC-12

LiteLLM imports successfully and can be configured for the local LLM.

### AC-13

The environment validation command succeeds:

```bash
uv run python scripts/check_environment.py
```

### AC-14

The automated tests succeed:

```bash
uv run pytest
```

### AC-15

No agent/self-improvement functionality has been implemented.

